  <p style="letter-spacing:2px;font-size:0.8em;color:#c9a84c;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>The Betta Skimmer Lineup, Explained</strong></p>
  <h2 style="color:#232739;font-size:1.8em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;">Solar-Powered Pool Surface Skimming, Set and Forget</h2>

  <p>Leaves, pollen, bugs, and blown-in debris land on the pool surface constantly, and if nothing skims them off within a day or two, they sink, break down, and become a floor-cleaning problem instead of a quick surface pass. Betta builds robotic pool skimmers built specifically for that job: patrolling the surface continuously so debris gets collected before it ever has the chance to sink.</p>

  <p>Yard Automation Pros carries four active Betta models: the SE, SE Plus, Flex, and Neo. All four share the same core approach, solar and cordless operation, twin Salt Chlorine Tolerant (SCT) motors, ultrasonic radar sensors for obstacle awareness, a UV-resistant body built to live on the water full time, and a large easy-clean debris basket. Where they differ is charging flexibility, physical design, and how much remote control and connectivity you get.</p>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/product1_1_1080x_be329190-1cea-4931-9a12-803b21565a26.png?v=1788977950" alt="Betta SE robotic pool skimmer" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 24px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080">

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:36px;">What Every Betta Skimmer Has in Common</h3>

  <p>Every model in the lineup runs on solar power, cordless, with no plumbing connection and no permanent installation required. Twin Salt Chlorine Tolerant motors mean the skimmers are built to run in saltwater pools without the corrosion issues that affect equipment designed only for chlorinated fresh water. Ultrasonic radar sensors give each unit obstacle and edge awareness so it patrols the pool surface without needing to be steered, and a UV-resistant body is built to withstand constant sun exposure floating on the water, not just occasional outdoor use. A large, easy-clean debris basket means emptying the catch is a quick task, not a disassembly project, and Smart Auto Clean lets the skimmer manage its own patrol pattern without you setting a route.</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin:48px 0 0;">
  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:48px;">Betta SE: The Starting Point</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/Cordelssand100_SolarPowered_1080x_0f9928cb-97b8-40de-b8ad-118b25805487.png?v=1788977948" alt="Betta SE cordless and 100% solar powered" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080">

  <p>The Betta SE is the entry point into the lineup, 100% solar powered and fully cordless, with remote control operation included. It carries the same twin SCT motors, ultrasonic radar sensors, UV-resistant body, and large easy-clean debris basket as the rest of the lineup, and it's available in White and Blue. For pool owners who want reliable surface skimming without paying for app connectivity or a secondary charging option, the SE covers the core job well.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Betta SE Plus: Dual Charging, Shallow-Water Safeguard</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/Solar-PowerCharging_AdapterCharging2_1080x_88bb006c-bef5-48f1-b8ba-6c1a66dc0001.png?v=1788989367" alt="Betta SE Plus solar power charging and adapter charging" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1080" height="1080">

  <p>The SE Plus builds on the SE with dual power options, solar charging for normal operation plus a wall-adapter charging option for days when sunlight alone isn't enough. It also adds a Shallow Safeguard Design, built-in awareness that helps the skimmer operate appropriately in shallower sections of the pool rather than treating the whole pool as uniform depth. It ships in Gray with remote control operation included, and carries the same twin SCT motors, ultrasonic sensors, and easy-clean basket as the SE.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Betta Flex: Compact, Soft-Touch, Infinity Pool Compatible</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/Soft-Touch_Casing_-_Flex_Blue_1500x_79aa1d30-15de-4147-a500-fb0d7dc7b73b.png?v=1788989478" alt="Betta Flex soft-touch casing" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1500">

  <p>The Flex is the compact model in the lineup, lightweight with a soft-touch casing designed to be gentler on pool surfaces and edges, including infinity-edge pools where a bulkier skimmer might be a poor fit. It offers dual cleaning modes, Eco and Normal, so you can favor longer patrol time or more thorough coverage depending on how the pool is being used that week. Like the SE Plus, it supports dual charging (solar plus adapter), and carries the same ultrasonic radar sensor and UV-resistant body construction as the rest of the lineup.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Betta Neo: App Control and Weather-Adaptive Cleaning</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/SmartAppControl_1500x_111dfcf9-8e77-4d5d-aaa9-391a7550d03f.png?v=1788975891" alt="Betta Neo smart app control" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1500">

  <p>The Neo is the flagship of the lineup, the only model with full smart app control through a gateway system that lets you check on and control the skimmer from anywhere, not just from beside the pool. Weather-Adaptive Cleaning adjusts its patrol behavior based on current conditions rather than running an identical routine regardless of wind or debris load, and Smart Navigation combines ultrasonic sensors with a more capable routing system for more consistent coverage. It carries dual charging options (solar and adapter), the same twin SCT motor and UV-resistant construction as the rest of the lineup, and is available in Blue and Gray.</p>

