  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Robotic Skimming vs. Manual Netting</h3>

  <p>The alternative to a robotic skimmer is walking out with a net every day or two, which works fine as a routine as long as you actually keep up with it. Miss a few days, especially during a windy or high-pollen stretch, and floating debris sinks, breaks down, and stains the pool floor or clogs the filtration system instead of coming out in one easy pass.</p>

