  <p>Not sure which Betta model fits your pool and how you use it? <a href="/pages/schedule-your-professional-consultation" style="color:#232739;font-weight:bold;">Book a free consultation</a> and we'll walk through your setup honestly, including telling you when the entry-level model covers everything you actually need.</p>

